  , adGroupCommonIsCreativeOptimization :: !(Maybe Bool) -- ^ "is_creative_optimization" - Enable creative optimization for the ad group, default value is FALSE. When enabled, you allow Pinterest to automatically turn your product Pins into ads in different formats (collections and shopping) and deliver those ads to users at scale.
