  , adGroupUpdateRequestIsCreativeOptimization :: !(Maybe Bool) -- ^ "is_creative_optimization" - Enable creative optimization for the ad group, default value is FALSE. When enabled, you allow Pinterest to automatically turn your product Pins into ads in different formats (collections and shopping) and deliver those ads to users at scale.
  , adGroupUpdateRequestLifetimeFrequencyCap :: !(Maybe Int) -- ^ "lifetime_frequency_cap" - Set a limit to the number of times a promoted pin from this campaign can be impressed by a pinner within the past rolling 30 days. Only available for CPM (cost per mille (1000 impressions))  ad groups. A CPM ad group has an IMPRESSION &lt;a href&#x3D;\&quot;/docs/redoc/#section/Billable-event\&quot;&gt;billable_event&lt;/a&gt; value. This field **REQUIRES** the &#x60;end_time&#x60; field.
