  , adsAnalyticsCreateAsyncRequestClickWindowDays :: !(Maybe ConversionAttributionWindowDays) -- ^ "click_window_days" - Number of days to use as the conversion attribution window for a pin click action. Applies to Pinterest Tag conversion metrics. Prior conversion tags use their defined attribution windows. If not specified, defaults to &#x60;30&#x60; days.
  , adsAnalyticsCreateAsyncRequestConversionReportTime :: !(Maybe ConversionReportTimeType) -- ^ "conversion_report_time" - The date by which the conversion metrics returned from this endpoint will be reported. There are two dates associated with a conversion event: the date that the user interacted with the ad, and the date that the user completed a conversion event.
